{"ID":"20240513083250-ij15qkk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083250-ij15qkk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083250-ij15qkk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513132505-7yura2a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513132505-7yura2a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513132505-7yura2a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:444,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:444\u0026#125;","title":"121","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123209"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513132505-7yura2a","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 874px;","id":"20240513132505-7yura2a","updated":"20240515123209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"093-6 P, K"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/5/14"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳癌復診，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.目前月經大量來了14天，現仍有，自覺左乳房壓力減輕，同時皮膚開始長回來"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服藥之後,有月經且大量,出很多血塊,比以前更大塊;左乳硬塊縮小中; 每次月經來後,左乳硬塊就縮小，且表面已長出健康的皮膚來。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 睡眠:不好，每小時小便一次，睡淺 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 大便:每日行"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 小便:淡黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 口渴:無，喜溫飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 有時全身覺得冷"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→出血過多而造成怕冷的現象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 體力好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 左乳表面及其中均覺熱"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→女子胸為陽，陰實在其中，陽不入陰，故熱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 右乳(正常)表面涼"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→陽潛於陰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、 視力畏光"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→土不制水，濕盛、陽不足，用甘淡滲利去脾濕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 緩有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：淡白紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎區瞳孔過大，脾區過小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 土不能制水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人進步中， 脾土虛不制腎陽"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1)同4/8方用黃連二錢，黃芩三錢，白芍五錢，瓦愣子五錢，炒麥芽五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡蠣一兩，防己五錢，黃芪五錢，桂枝三錢，炙甘草五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烏藥五錢，細辛二錢，當歸二錢，川芎三錢，生地三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"丹皮三錢，桃仁三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"服用此方後5年沒來的月經已大量的排出，左乳房因月經排出後已減壓及縮小許多，故繼續服用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"caps 400粒 8 x 3 三餐飯前服用"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2) 胃苓湯400 caps 8 x 3三餐飯後服用"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"視力畏光 因為土不水治土濕太勝，用胃苓湯加強脾胃去濕祛痰功能 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身體有時覺得冷 出血過多 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左奶熱（患側），右奶涼（健側）患側有陰實存在，陽不入陰，故患側是熱的"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註：1.此患者個性開朗，也是使病情好轉的重要原因—"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"無懼則不傷陽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]}]}]}